invalid type: string "Withdrawal Policy\nWithdrawals\nWithdrawal from the GEM Explorer Exchange programme only applies after students accept their Allocation Offer. Actions prior to that, such as\ncancelling online application or rejecting an Allocation Offer by the deadline, are NOT considered a withdrawal and will NOT incur any\nwithdrawal fees or affect priority for future applications.\nÿÿÿÿÿÿ